e to start again. If you extract from the raid with a \"Run Through\" status, you will not reset the quest, but that raid will not count as being completed. To avoid the \"Run Through\" status, gain at least 200 ","type":"text"},{"content":"EXP","href":"https://escapefromtarkov.fandom.com/wiki/EXP","title":"EXP","type":"link"},{"content":" in raid (by killing or looting) or be in raid for at least 7 minutes before extracting. You do not have to do the maps in any order, they can be done in any fashion as long as you survive.\n","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"content":"This quest can also be completed in a single raid when using transits.\n","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"nextQuests":null}}